; Regression for PR.md F4: in the boxed backend, releasing a deeply
; left-nested list recursed through the head and overflowed the native stack
; (about 400k levels).  The typed backend rejects the infinite type
; (t = [t]), hence --allow-dynamic; release is iterative now and live=0
; verifies the whole structure is reclaimed.
nest → (λn acc.
  if (== n 0)
  then acc
  else (nest (- n 1) (cons acc nil)))
xs → (nest 400000 nil)
0
